2. FULL-RANKING TEST (cameraPR, corrected for inter-gene correlation)
========================================================================================================================================================================================================
  Uses all 12,368 genes' t-statistics rather than a cut at 50, so it is far better powered
  for a weak diffuse signal -- and it discounts the shared leukocyte-composition structure
  that would otherwise read as pathway enrichment.
calcNormFactors has been renamed to normLibSizes

